## 目标

从 a045_s42 和 a045_s43 的原始分析 JSON 中提取 8 pairs × 2 seeds 的完整 fdr_p 值，生成 fdr_gradient 表格。Paper Agent appendix 需要。

## 数据源

分析结果在 westd-17855 服务器上。需要 SSH 读取以下路径（推测路径，需确认）：
- `/root/autodl-tmp/distrib_canary_collapse/results/alpha_sweep/a045_s42_fp32/` 下的分析 JSON
- `/root/autodl-tmp/distrib_canary_collapse/results/alpha_sweep/a045_s43_fp32/` 下的分析 JSON

分析 JSON 通常命名为 `lead_lag_analysis_*.json` 或 `5method_analysis_*.json`。

也检查本地 artifacts 目录:
- `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_4/projects/distrib_canary_collapse/artifacts/alpha_sweep_a045_s42_fp32/`
- `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_4/projects/distrib_canary_collapse/artifacts/alpha_sweep_a045_s43_fp32/`

## 提取内容

对每个实验（s42, s43），提取：
- 8 canonical pairs: {token_entropy, ece} × {distinct_1, distinct_2, distinct_3, mauve}
- 每对的 perm_granger forward: raw_p, fdr_p, significant_fdr
- 每对的 perm_granger reverse: raw_p, fdr_p, significant_fdr (如有)

## 输出

写入 `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_4/projects/distrib_canary_collapse/artifacts/fdr_gradient_a045.json`:
```json
{
  "generated_at": "2026-05-20T...",
  "description": "Complete fdr_p gradient for α=0.45 onset boundary, 8 pairs × 2 seeds",
  "seeds": {
    "s42": {
      "exp_id": "alpha_sweep_a045_s42_fp32",
      "pairs": [
        {
          "canary": "token_entropy",
          "downstream": "distinct_1",
          "forward": {"raw_p": ..., "fdr_p": ..., "significant_fdr": false},
          "reverse": {"raw_p": ..., "fdr_p": ..., "significant_fdr": false}
        },
        ...
      ],
      "summary": {"min_fdr_p": ..., "mean_fdr_p": ..., "sig_count": 0}
    },
    "s43": {
      ...
    }
  },
  "cross_seed_summary": {
    "min_fdr_p_across_seeds": ...,
    "pattern": "..."
  }
}
```

用 `register_artifact` 注册（type="data", name="fdr_gradient_a045", tags=["D139", "onset", "fdr_p", "appendix"]）。

